      "id": "claim_e8353f75afc54647a3b070062c5520df",
      "statement": "Development traffic to Pixiv and GitHub requires a local HTTP proxy: the app-lynx dev server reads `https_proxy` / `HTTPS_PROXY` / `http_proxy` / `HTTP_PROXY` and falls back to `http://127.0.0.1:7897`, and emulator E2E needs the equivalent device-level setting `adb shell settings put global http_proxy 10.0.2.2:7897`, without which OAuth and GitHub calls black-hole (symptoms include a hung splash or login timeout).",
