      "statement": "The client package's own script surface is non-obvious: `check` composes `vue-tsc -p src/tsconfig.json` with `tsc -p tsconfig.node.json`, `test` runs Vitest twice (default config then `vitest.fallback.config.ts`), and `lint` / `fmt` are intentional no-op echoes while app-lynx style debt is repaid under ADR-0185, so a green repo-wide `lint:all` does not mean app-lynx was linted.",
